==English==

===Etymology===
{{lb|en|onomatopoeia}}. Connected with {{m|en|splash}} and {{m|en|splish}}. Compare also {{m|en|slosh}}.

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|ɒʃ|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|es}}

# To make a heavy [[splash]]ing sound.
# To [[traverse]] [[mushy]] or [[marshy]] wetlands.
# To [[spill]] or [[spill over]].

